# Refactor

When the user says **refactor**, reorganize the target Python file. Keep behavior the same.

## Imports

Put every import at the top under `# -- Imports --`. Remove later and duplicate imports.

1. Standard library, one per line, alphabetical.
2. Blank line.
3. Third-party imports, alphabetical by module.

## Banners

- File header: `# ---- Title ----` plus one sentence on what the file does.
- Each logical block: `# ---- Section name ----`.
- Small setup blocks, such as imports or env loading: `# -- Name --`.

Match this shape:

```python
# ---- SQL Agent ----
# One sentence describing the file.

# -- Imports --

import os

from langchain_ollama import ChatOllama

# -- Load environment variables --

# ---- Connect to the database ----

# ---- Run the agent ----
```
